<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav June copper, silver output rise in June.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav June copper, silver output rise in June.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following metal production details.</p>
<p> NON-FERROUS METAL PRODUCTION   June 96   May 96     June 95</p>
<p> electrolytic copper (tonnes)  12,173    10,759	6,927</p>
<p> refined lead			 3,314     3,235	   --</p>
<p> zinc				   1,812     1,890	  621</p>
<p> aluminium ingots		   3,658     2,967	1,078</p>
<p> refined silver (kilos)	   7,627     6,179	  845</p>
<p>YUGOSLAV NON-FERROUS ORES</p>
<p> copper (thousand tonnes)	 1,669     1,738	1,728</p>
<p> lead-zinc				 64	  73	   37</p>
<p> bauxite				   38	  27	   --</p>
<p>-- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 2224305</p>
</text>
